ければ…！」と焦りや困惑を覚えているもの（でもセックスで気持ちよくなってはいる）が理想的です。月は目の前にいるのが魅上だと気づいてない様子でお願いします。\n\nその他依頼文に書かれていないことはダミィさんにお任せいたします。描きやすいようにご自由に改変しても大丈夫です。\nもし何か問題があれば遠慮なくキャンセル、もしくは再送依頼を送っていただいて構いません。よろしくお願い致します！", "nc": 185, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 66594, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "ルッキー井上", "screen_name": "lucky_inoue", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1898686209754628096/2nHH7XzE.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/938342988/1741517043/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "novel"}], "banned": false, "nc": 177}, {"id": 112268, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "ゆのどん🔞", "screen_name": "yunodon_eco", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1936444420456398848/lQAl-xhJ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/190816933/1756801605/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 3, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 161}, {"id": 174905, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "ちびねこ", "screen_name": "chibineco_m", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/497673356691243009/S5eRNA50.jpeg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/107930554/1422759736/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "ski